{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Q8JyhpXKZyDPnxRJq516Se","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME Start Here · Brief [7:2] 0,0 1440x5868 fill#ffffff\n  FRAME Header [7:3] 64,64 1312x145\n    TEXT LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2 [7:4] 0,0 182x19 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT FASCO — fashion store website [7:5] 0,31 1312x52 :: FASCO — fashion store website\n    TEXT Design a fashion e-commerce website: land on the home page, browse the shop, open a product, add it to the cart, review the cart, check out, and sign up, sign in or recover an account. Desktop web, 1920 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference. [7:6] 0,95 1312x50 :: Design a fashion e-commerce website: land on the home page, browse the shop, open a product, add it to the cart, review the cart, check out, and sign up, sign in or recover an account. Desktop web, 1920 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME How to work [7:7] 64,257 1312x249\n    TEXT How to work [7:8] 0,0 147x35 :: How to work\n    TEXT 1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the two typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, the avatars, the sign-in 