{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_yls76pyo6utwhr7yqzmihdyp77jiplfufgjwofz7j7bf3vpb7t7q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 11 FASCO screens are built in **03 · Workspace**, with their components and the clickable prototype. I checked every screen in screenshots. The reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were only read, not changed. I was signed in as zuohaosheng@tetras.ai.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/VywcToy5Ws9bCiebYSfh91/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `8:2`\n\n**Screens** (each 1920 wide, laid out left to right in one row):\n\n| Frame | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Home | `16:146` |\n| 02_Shop | `17:474` |\n| 03_Product | `18:686` |\n| 04_Mini_Cart | `19:909` |\n| 05_Cart | `19:1059` |\n| 06_Checkout | `22:1040` |\n| 07_Sign_Up | `23:1139` |\n| 08_Sign_In | `23:1190` |\n| 09_Forgot_Password | `23:1224` |\n| 10_Confirmation_Code | `23:1256` |\n| 11_New_Password | `23:1275` |\n\n**Components** (board \"Components · FASCO\", `11:2`, placed to the left of the screens):\n- **Headers and footers:** the home header, a store header with four versions (current page Shop, Products or none; cart count 0 or 1), the nav item with a current state, and the footer in home and store versions.\n- **Small controls:** Category Tab, Size Chip, Color Swatch, Pagination Item, View Toggle, Checkbox, Rating, Quantity Stepper, Countdown Unit, Breadcrumb, Outline Button, Social Button, Filter Tag, carousel arrows and OR divider.\n- **Text fields:** a focused field plus a dropdown field and a card-number field with a lock icon. All of them are built from the provided Text Field.\n- **Larger blocks:** product cards for New Arrivals and for the shop (normal and Sold Out), Testimonial Card (normal and current), Hero Collage, Brand Strip, Deals Section (also reused as People Also Loved), Collection Banner, Feature Strip, Instagram Strip, Newsletter, Mini Cart Drawer, Cart Row and Auth Terms.\n- **Reuse of the source files:** the screens use the provided Button and Text Field and the photos, avatars, logos and icons from 04 · Media as instances.\n- **Visual rules:** all text is in Volkhov and Poppins, and the brand color is #000000. A token legend on the board lists the other colors, type sizes, spacing, corner radii, shadow and grid.\n\n**Prototype:** 34 click links, all set to Smart Animate. The flow starts at 01_Home.\n- **01:** SHOP NOW and View More go to 02; Sign in goes to 08; Sign Up goes to 07.\n- **02–06:** any product card goes to 03. In the store header, the cart icon goes to 05, the account icon goes to 08, and Shop goes to 02.\n- **03–05:** Add to cart goes to 04. In the mini cart, View Cart goes to 05, Checkout goes to 06, and close returns to 03. On the cart page, Checkout goes to 06 and Denim Jacket goes to 03.\n- **06–11:** Create Account goes to 07. On 07, Create Account goes to 01 and Login to 08. On 08, Sign In goes to 01, Register Now to 07, and Forgot Password? to 09. On 09, Send Confirmation Code goes to 10 and Login to 08. On 10, Recover Account goes to 11. On 11, Submit goes to 01.\n\nI wired links on the main components (headers, hero, shop card, drawer, cart row), so every copy of them carries the link. I checked that the copies on the screens kept them.\n\n**Limitations:**\n- **No link for entry-only items:** as the brief specifies, buttons like Pay Now, Buy Now, filters and tabs have no link.\n- **04_Mini_Cart is one 1920 × 1080 screen:** it shows the top of the product page with a dark overlay and the cart drawer, rather than an overlay on the full scrolling page.\n- **Invented form text:** the brief doesn't specify hint text for form fields, so I wrote it myself, for example \"First name\", \"MM / YY\" and the confirmation code \"4 8 2 9 1 6\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":143666,"cache_read_input_tokens":7698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_i